       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. COMPFLOATDEMO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 SINGLE-VAL   COMP-1.
       01 DOUBLE-VAL   COMP-2.
       01 RESULT-OUT   PIC -(4)9.9(6).
       01 DIAMETER     COMP-2 VALUE 10.
       01 CIRCUMF      COMP-2.
       01 PI-VALUE     COMP-2 VALUE 3.14159265358979.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
      * COMP-1 is single precision, COMP-2 is double precision.
           COMPUTE SINGLE-VAL = 1 / 3
           COMPUTE DOUBLE-VAL = 1 / 3

           MOVE SINGLE-VAL TO RESULT-OUT
           DISPLAY "SINGLE 1/3: " RESULT-OUT
           MOVE DOUBLE-VAL TO RESULT-OUT
           DISPLAY "DOUBLE 1/3: " RESULT-OUT

           COMPUTE CIRCUMF = PI-VALUE * DIAMETER
           MOVE CIRCUMF TO RESULT-OUT
           DISPLAY "CIRCUMFERENCE: " RESULT-OUT

           COMPUTE DOUBLE-VAL = FUNCTION SQRT(2)
           MOVE DOUBLE-VAL TO RESULT-OUT
           DISPLAY "SQRT(2): " RESULT-OUT
           STOP RUN.
